# Challenge scope

This repository is the video localization case study. Design artifacts (diagrams, ADRs, workflow, trade-offs) are the product. Add pipeline resources only after the ADR for that decision exists.

Application code is TypeScript. Infrastructure is AWS CDK under `infra/`. The test UI is a Next.js static export under `client/`.

Deploy from a laptop with `cdk deploy`. Do not add a GitLab or GitHub Actions pipeline.

Sample videos stay on disk. Never commit `*.mp4`.
